      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.23 (vs ₹0.88 loss in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.23 (up from ₹0.88 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹132.0m (up 116% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹57.6m (up ₹281.4m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 44% (up from net loss in FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 125% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 40% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
