      "date": "2026-01-06T19:19:00.000Z",
      "title": "Sri Adhikari Brothers Television Network Limited Appoints Srivatsava Sunkara as Chairperson, Effective January 6, 2026",
      "body": "Sri Adhikari Brothers Television Network Limited, in its meeting held on January 6, 2026, approved the appointment of Srivatsava Sunkara as Chairperson of the Company, effective January 6, 2026, as disclosed in the company's regulatory filings. Sunkara brings extensive experience in Artificial Intelligence and the development of Large Language Models (LLMs), with a proven track record of transforming organisational operations to enhance efficiency and foster innovation. He has no familial or professional relationship with any existing directors of the Company and is not debarred from holding the office of director by any order of SEBI or other authorities.",
