      "title": "Sri Adhikari Brothers Television Network Limited Announces Resignation of Kiran Kumar Inampudi as Chairperson, Effective January 6, 2026",
      "body": "Sri Adhikari Brothers Television Network Limited announced that Mr. Kiran Kumar Inampudi resigned from the position of Chairperson of the board, effective from January 6, 2026. He will continue serving as an Executive Director, contributing actively to the Board. He has confirmed that there are no material reasons for his resignation other than mentioned in his resignation letter.",
